    {
      "id": "claim_5b4fc2b50fca4956ad7d60a503785d7b",
      "statement": "Placing the character exactly on a target makes planted feet slide, because the correction moves the root while the animation's legs carry on doing what the clip said; a foot-locking stage after RootFollowStage is the intended fix and is not yet written, which is what footskatePerMeter measures the cost of.",
